cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Autonomous LiDAR Exploration with Frontiers and Dubins RRT*"
abstract: >-
  ROS 2 Jazzy package for autonomous exploration with a 2-D lidar: frontier
  viewpoints scored by ray-cast information gain, Dubins RRT* path planning and
  pure pursuit, on slam_toolbox maps, evaluated in Gazebo Harmonic. The original
  ROS Noetic version is kept at tag ros1-noetic.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Pravin
    family-names: Oli
version: 1.0.0
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - ROS 2
  - autonomous exploration
  - RRT*
  - Dubins path
  - pure pursuit
  - frontier exploration
  - slam_toolbox
